## TECHNICAL ARCHITECTURE (Quick Reference)

### File Structure:
```
src/
├── boot.py              - Boot sequence (runs first)
├── main.py              - Game loop (entry point)
├── config.py            - All constants (tuning parameters)
└── lib/
    ├── space_marine.py  - Core logic (stats, evolution)
    ├── ui.py            - Display/input (M5Stack abstraction)
    ├── save_manager.py  - Persistence (JSON, atomic)
    └── chaos_system.py  - Chaos whispers (Phase 3)
```

### Key Classes:

**SpaceMarine** (space_marine.py):
- 5 main stats: geneseed_purity, battle_fury, sustenance, discipline, corruption
- Evolution stages: Neophyte → Scout → Battle Brother → Veteran
- Chapter determination algorithm (_determine_chapter)
- 11 evolution paths implemented

**AstartesUI** (ui.py):
- Hardware abstraction (works on PC + device)
- render(marine) - main render loop
- get_input() - touch button handling
- Currently in stub mode (needs M5Stack hardware to fully test)

**SaveManager** (save_manager.py):
- Atomic writes (temp file → rename)
- Backup system (*.bak)
- JSON format

### Hardware Platform:

- **Device**: M5Stack Core2 v1.1
- **Chip**: ESP32-S3
- **Screen**: 320x240 touchscreen
- **Firmware**: MicroPython (custom M5Stack build)

